      "statement": "Pins that cannot mean the obvious thing carry a stated reason: the NGINX hash fixes the reviewed artifact because nginx.org publishes no checksum file, the Redis pin uses the published release tarball because a GitHub tag archive's bytes are not stable, and Playwright rather than Chromium is pinned because Playwright resolves and verifies the browser download itself.",
